# St. Luke's Play Console target SDK

Google Play rejects St. Luke's School (`in.stlukestura.school`) uploads that target API 35.

When rebuilding the school AAB/APK:

- Keep `apps/school-mobile/plugins/with-android-target-sdk-36.js` plus `scripts/build-local-apk.js` gradle.properties patch at **compile/target SDK 36 or higher**.
- Bump `android.versionCode` (and `scripts/build-local-apk.js`) for every Play upload. Current source is 19.
- Sign with the St. Luke's upload keystore only. Do not use the college app keystore or college `apps/mobile` config.
- After a successful local AAB, copy the signed file to Desktop as `StLukes-School-v*-vc*.aab`.
- App Store iOS builds must use EAS image `macos-sequoia-15.6-xcode-26.2` (Xcode 26 / iOS 26 SDK). Apple rejects iOS 18.5 SDK binaries (ITMS-90725).
